            </note>
            <note corresp="#d299-f3" n="44" xml:id="d299-f3-content">
                <p>By despatch No. 317, July 13, 1936, the Minister reported that “smuggling from
                    Puerto Barrios has ceased”. (811.114 Guatemala/90)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
